🎯 CS2 Skin Sniper — SaaS

Real-time skin scanner, cross-marketplace arbitrage detector & automated buying bot for CS2.


🚀 What is this?
CS2 Skin Sniper is a SaaS platform built to give traders a serious edge on the CS2 skin market.
It scans multiple resale marketplaces every few seconds, surfaces underpriced items, and (eventually) pulls the trigger automatically — so you don't have to.
This project is a work in progress built by a solo dev who believes the idea is worth pursuing.
If you're an experienced developer and this catches your eye — I'm open to collaborators, mentors, or just a good conversation. Let's build something.

🗺️ Roadmap
Phase 1 — Smart Scanner & Sniper

Real-time scan of CS2 marketplaces (CSFloat, Skinport, DMarket, Buff163, Steam…)
Configurable scan interval per user
Ultra-granular item filters:

Float value (exact range)
Pattern / Seed ID
Phase (Doppler, Case Hardened blue gems, Fade %)
Sticker presence, position, wear & value
StatTrak / Souvenir toggle
Price range (min/max)


Instant alerts: Discord webhook, email, in-app notification
Full history dashboard of found listings

Phase 2 — Cross-Marketplace Arbitrage

Real-time price comparison across all major platforms
Automatic net profit calculation (buy price + platform fees + CSFloat fees + liquidity buffer)
Deal score based on: deviation from median price, estimated resale speed, historical volume
"Live opportunities" view sorted by ROI
Price history charts per item
Reference pricing via Pricempire / Steam Analyst

Phase 3 — Automated Buying Bot

Semi-automatic bot with randomized delay (purchase triggered +20 to +45s after detection)
Strict rate limiting: max 10 purchases/hour (user-configurable)
Mandatory item whitelist before any auto-buy
Dry-run mode to test strategies without spending a cent
Full audit logs for every attempt (success, failure, reason)
Auto-pause on abnormal behavior detection


